{"code":0,"data":{"title":"vivo阅图内容平台使用指导","content":"<h2 id=\"s-hxbda6yf\">1、登录内容平台</h2><p>商业账户企业资质审核通过后，点击vivo开放平台右上角的“登录”，然后从顶部产品导航-“内容分发”处进入阅图内容平台（<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mp.vivo.com.cn\">https://mp.vivo.com.cn</a>）</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221021/awyxrt/20221021163108537016.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"201\" data-natural-width=\"1516\" data-natural-height=\"254\" data-type=\"image\"><br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165615240181h.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"412\" data-natural-width=\"1360\" data-natural-height=\"509\" data-type=\"image\"><br></p><h2 id=\"s-jwui7sa3\">2、设置服务号</h2><p>阅图壁纸左下角显示的就是服务号名称，在内容平台上传壁纸之前必须要设置好服务号名称。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165628849i412.png\" data-natural-width=\"1081\" data-natural-height=\"589\" data-type=\"image\">从内容平台右上角的菜单进入“内容设置“<br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/2019030416564050117xo.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1101\" height=\"411\" data-natural-width=\"1357\" data-natural-height=\"506\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>点击新增服务号</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165652618p377.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"428\" data-natural-width=\"1326\" data-natural-height=\"748\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-3oyujm5b\">3、上传单图</h2><p>选中“单图”分类，点击“新增”进入单图上传页面<br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/2019030416570839883y6.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1103\" height=\"404\" data-natural-width=\"1368\" data-natural-height=\"501\" data-type=\"image\"><br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165720825kt85.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1101\" height=\"521\" data-natural-width=\"1381\" data-natural-height=\"654\" data-type=\"image\">点击中间的“+”即可上传图片，图片必须要遵守红框处的注释要求。</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-787morij\">4、上传组图</h2><p>选中“组图”分类，点击“新增”进入组图上传页面</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165738447msfy.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1108\" height=\"400\" data-natural-width=\"1378\" data-natural-height=\"498\" data-type=\"image\"><br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/docmanage/20190304/20190304165752847le7u.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" width=\"1102\" height=\"499\" data-natural-width=\"1369\" data-natural-height=\"620\" data-type=\"image\">点击中间的“+”即可上传图片，图片必须要遵守红框处的注释要求。</p><p></p>","versionCode":5,"updateTime":1709892398000,"breadCrumbs":"阅图内容平台,平台使用指南","docType":3,"docMessageType":"content_distribution"}}